		{"id":"root","x":0,"y":0,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"# Claude Code\n## 5大隐藏神技"},
		{"id":"n1","x":0,"y":-300,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"## 1. CLAUDE.md\n\n- **项目大脑**：自动加载项目上下文\n- **规范统一**：设定 API/Linter 规则\n- **持久化**：新人入职指南"},
		{"id":"n2","x":400,"y":-150,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"## 2. 自定义 Slash 命令\n\n- **脚本化**：把 Prompt 变成指令\n- **复用性**：`/project:commit` 一键执行\n- **效率**：减少重复打字"},
		{"id":"n3","x":300,"y":200,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## 3. Shell 穿透 (!)\n\n- **直接控制**：`!ls` `!npm install`\n- **越狱**：跳过解释直接执行\n- **管道**：获取输出并分析"},
		{"id":"n4","x":-300,"y":200,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"## 4. GitHub 集成\n\n- **gh CLI**：深度绑定\n- **闭环**：Issue -> Code -> Test -> PR\n- **自动化**：AI 实习生模式"},
		{"id":"n5","x":-400,"y":-150,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"6","type":"text","text":"## 5. Session 管理\n\n- **状态保持**：永远不丢失上下文\n- **命令**：`/resume` 恢复, `/search` 搜索\n- **管理**：`/rename` 标记关键任务"}
